# Oscillitron demo configuration — .properties format.
#
# CLAUDE GENERATED
#
# This file fills in any setting the user did NOT pass as a CLI flag.
# CLI flags always win. Lines starting with '#' or '!' are comments;
# duplicate keys: last write wins.
#
# Use:
#   go run ./cmd/oscillitron --config oscillitron.properties
#   OSCILLITRON_CONFIG=oscillitron.properties go run ./cmd/oscillitron
#
# Under the uniform-node lock, specialization lives in the playbook
# substrate keyed by action — there are no distinct brain-function
# nodes. Endpoints below are keyed by playbook action tag (plan,
# process, critique, verify_grounded, compose), matching the v0
# playbook set.
#
# The demo wires both single-endpoint (hermes.url) and multi-endpoint
# (hermes.endpoints.*.url) configurations. Multi-endpoint takes
# precedence when any per-playbook URL is set, and when active it
# requires an evaluate endpoint plus all five playbook endpoints.

# ----- Single-endpoint case: one Hermes serves every playbook.
# (Easiest for v0 dev — point at one local `hermes gateway` on :8642.)

# hermes.url=http://127.0.0.1:8642
# hermes.model=openrouter:openai/gpt-4o-mini

# ----- Multi-endpoint case: one Hermes PER playbook action.
# (Per-instance playbook substrate — each playbook's persistent store
# is its own long-lived Hermes process. Spawn N gateways on different
# ports and bind them here.)
#
# When ANY hermes.endpoints.* entry is present, the single-endpoint
# settings above are ignored. The evaluate endpoint is required (it
# powers the cheap-local-first playbook-pick step) and every playbook
# must have its own URL.

# hermes.endpoints.evaluate.url=http://127.0.0.1:8641
# hermes.endpoints.evaluate.model=openrouter:openai/gpt-4o-mini
# hermes.endpoints.plan.url=http://127.0.0.1:8642
# hermes.endpoints.plan.model=openrouter:openai/gpt-4o-mini
# hermes.endpoints.process.url=http://127.0.0.1:8643
# hermes.endpoints.process.model=openrouter:openai/gpt-4o-mini
# hermes.endpoints.critique.url=http://127.0.0.1:8644
# hermes.endpoints.critique.model=openrouter:anthropic/claude-3.5-haiku
# hermes.endpoints.verify_grounded.url=http://127.0.0.1:8645
# hermes.endpoints.verify_grounded.model=openrouter:openai/gpt-4o-mini
# hermes.endpoints.compose.url=http://127.0.0.1:8646
# hermes.endpoints.compose.model=openrouter:openai/gpt-4o-mini

# ----- Misc.

# timeout=5m
